            "heading": "Heart-Conscious Daily Support",
            "content": "<p><strong>Aged garlic extract</strong></p><ul><li>Designed to support everyday cardiovascular wellness.</li><li>Simple to include in everyday wellness habits.</li><li>Provides naturally occurring antioxidant support from aged garlic.</li><li>CoQ10 supports normal cellular energy production.</li><li>Gentle, odorless aged garlic softgel format.</li></ul>"
