          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Can I Expect?",
            "content": "<p>Avonent is designed for consistent everyday use as part of a heart-conscious wellness routine. The formula combines aged garlic with CoQ10 + ubiquinol while keeping the experience simple, convenient, and odorless.</p>"
          }
        },
