      "blocks": {
        "review_1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "author": "Peter La…",
            "country": "🇺🇸",
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "",
            "body": "<p>Getting older makes daily habits feel a little more important. Not looking for anything complicated these days, just products that are easy to stick with. That is probably what works best about Avonent. One softgel, no strong garlic smell, and done. It fits into the morning routine without needing much thought. Been trying to stay more mindful about long-term wellness, and this feels like one of those simple habits that is easy to keep around.</p>",
            "date": "05/20/2026",
            "verified": true,
            "excerpt": false
          }
        },
        "review_2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "author": "Carol Si…",
            "country": "🇺🇸",
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "",
            "body": "<p>These days, more attention goes into long-term wellness than quick fixes. Avonent has become part of that mindset. The simple routine, odorless softgels, and convenient format make it easy to stay consistent with healthy habits.</p>",
            "date": "05/05/2026",
            "verified": true,
            "excerpt": false
          }
        },
        "review_3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "author": "Carol Be…",
            "country": "🇺🇸",
            "rating": 4,
            "title": "",
            "body": "<p>Some supplements end up forgotten after a few weeks, but this one has stayed in rotation. The serving is simple, the softgels are comfortable to take, and the pouch keeps everything organized. It feels like a practical product designed for everyday use rather than something overly complicated.</p>",
            "date": "04/30/2026",
            "verified": true,
            "excerpt": false
          }
        },
        "review_4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "author": "Kenneth …",
            "country": "🇺🇸",
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "",
            "body": "<p>Healthy habits tend to work best when they are realistic enough to maintain. That is probably why Avonent has stayed part of the routine. The odorless softgels are convenient, the serving is simple, and everything feels designed around consistency rather than complexity.</p><p>Over time, more focus has gone toward making thoughtful choices and building routines that support long-term wellness goals. Avonent fits naturally into that approach.</p>",
            "date": "03/27/2026",
            "verified": true,
            "excerpt": true
          }
        },
        "review_5": {
